== Notes ==

*Added in the [[expansion pack]]s.
*The bonus damage (reported as [[divine damage]]) is from a [[damage increase]] effect, so it ignores both [[damage resistance]] and damage [[immunity]].
*The bonus damage is capped at 20. Increasing charisma above 51 will only increase the duration, not the damage, of this feat.
*This feat applies to the character, not to the weapon, and is therefore unaffected by changing weapons. It affects both ranged weapons and melee weapons.
*Using the feat while its effects are still active will not have an effect.
*This feat may only be selected when leveling as a [[blackguard]], [[paladin]] or [[cleric]].
* The bonus divine damage is multiplied by the weapon's critical multiplier in the case of a critical hit.
* This feat can be used while polymorphed.
* This feat is available as a [[cast spell]] item property, but using such a property still requires spending a ''turn undead'' attempt.

== Custom content notes ==
* ''script:'' <code>X0_S2_DivMight</code>
